SUMMARY:The Nation Wants to Know
DESCRIPTION:From Mumbai to New York\, laughter truly needs no visa! \nThis fast-paced\, razor-sharp comedic journeys through the quirks of modern India\, and how they echo with (or utterly confuse) audiences across the globe. With a signature blend of wit\, warmth\, and wild storytelling\, the topics move from the absurdities of colonial hangovers to the chaotic charm of startups\, social media spats\, and airline adventures. \nAfter sold-out performances world over\, the show brings back international tales\, asking what happens when India’s inside jokes meet the world’s outside gaze? \nVenue: Auditorium\n\n\nA Laugh Out Loud Look at Modern India\nFor Ages 14+\nRSVP here (https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdu3KcaxSwW8vSWhgW79nsHznFjyVa0wFYr2AL82jSUS2OeBg/viewform?usp=dialog)\n*Performer*: Anuvab Pal\n*Event Categories*: Performing Arts\, Society
URL:https://bangaloreinternationalcentre.org/event/the-nation-wants-to-know/
LOCATION:Bangalore International Centre\, 7\, 4th Main Road\, Domlur II Stage\, Bangalore\, Karnataka\, 560071\, India
CATEGORIES:Performing Arts,Society
