SUMMARY:Drawing Knowledge
DESCRIPTION:What can we learn about place and people from a detailed drawing? \nThis exhibition presents one of the largest private collections of architectural drawings of Rajasthan’s forts and palaces\, from Jaisalmer and Amber to Mehrangarh and Hawa Mahal. Each drawing is the product of years of research and meticulous documentation\, recording the walls\, courtyards\, and water systems that shaped life inside these buildings. \nComprehensive documentation of such places is increasingly scarce. Made possible by the mentorship of Kulbhushan Jain and Minakshi Jain\, the collection brings this accumulated knowledge into the public domain. It gives researchers\, students\, and curious visitors access to study the details closely\, now and for generations to come. \nExhibition Opening: 6:30pm\, Fri\, Nov 13\nExhibition Timings: 11am – 8pm | Fri\, Nov 13 – Sun\, Nov 15\nExhibition on show until: 8pm | Sun\, Nov 15 \nWalkthroughs:\n6:30pm | Fri\, Nov 13\n11am & 5:30pm | Sat\, Nov 14\n11am & 5:30pm | Sun\, Nov 15 \nBeyond the Lines | 7pm – 8:30pm | Fri\, Nov 13\nA panel discussion exploring how architectural drawings of Rajasthan’s forts and palaces serve as archives of architectural\, social and cultural knowledge\, and their potential for future scholarship.\n \nBuilt Before the Blueprint | 11:30am-1:30pm | Sat\, Nov 14\nA collaborative workshop inviting participants to read architectural drawings from the exhibition to discover how Rajasthan’s forts and palaces responded to their climate\, resources\, water needs and military strategies.\n \nHealth\, Heritage and Architecture | 6pm – 8pm | Nov 14\nA workshop exploring how traditional architecture created cool\, airy\, bright and healthy spaces without electricity\, using drawings from the exhibition. \nIn collaboration with: \n \nVenue: Gallery\n\n\nAct of Drawing: Learning from Rajasthan’s Forts\nRSVP here (https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfMmVZo_95Da9reBG1imWk_CRgxyR5awyQsdreZwiGTULhHOQ/viewform?usp=publish-editor)\n*Curatorial Team*: Meghal Arya\, Vijay Arya\, Kulbhushan Jain\, Minakshi Jain\n*Event Categories*: Architecture\, Cities\, Culture\, History
URL:https://bangaloreinternationalcentre.org/event/drawing-knowledge/
